OL,3,GNEWSAFriends group helps bereaved ward
OL,4,Aoff loneliness
OL,5,
OL,6,FA friendship group which has helped
OL,7,Fmany older people avoid loneliness and
OL,8,Fisolation has urged others to
OL,9,Fstrengthen friendship and social bonds
OL,10,Fbefore winter sets in.
OL,12,FHeart of the West Oddfellows runs
OL,13,Fregular social events, activities and
OL,14,Fmeet-ups across Torquay and Newton
OL,15,FAbbot in Devon.
OL,17,FSeptember is Friendship Month, and the
OL,18,Fgroup said that "as winter approaches,
OL,19,Fand the evenings become darker and
OL,20,Fshorter, many people have fewer social
OL,21,Fplans and can start to feel isolated".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
