OL,3,GNEWSAFriends group helps bereaved ward
OL,4,Aoff loneliness
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvents organiser Sam Wyton said members
OL,7,Fhelped "provide easy routes for older
OL,8,Ffolk to get to know each other, and
OL,9,Fthat the friendships formed have a real
OL,10,Fand lasting effect on wellbeing
OL,11,Fthroughout the year".
